sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    alt User confirms match
        App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
    else User rejects
        App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(false)
    end

    Note over App: Result surfaces on the outstanding<br>PairAndBond's PairingResult callback.<br>See "NumericComparison Authentication"<br>for the full flow.
    Note over App, Node: If the peripheral disconnects before the App confirms,<br>PairingResult may or may not fire before CurrentState(standby).<br>Reason: SMP is paused waiting on the local user response,<br>so the stack has no canonical cancellation event to raise.<br>Treat CurrentState(standby) as terminal.
